  "description": "<i>Soft BL Short Story Collection</i><br><br>\n Confessions left unsaid, Hands that never quite touched, Time that can never be reclaimed… Radiant, awkward, and enduring—\nThe indelible memories of first love. Stories that everyone has experienced, yet each one is unique.<br><br>(Source: KakaoPage, translated)<br><br>\n<u>Stories Included:</u><br>\n1. <b>Cheotsarang Gaejoilchi</b> (첫사랑 개조일치)<br>\n2. <b>Musojonjae</b> (무소존재)<br>\n3. <b>Ireumpyoreul Butyeo</b> (이름표를 붙여)<br>\n4. <b>A.</b> (A.)<br>\n5. <b>Yanghosil Chimdae Jaengtaljeon</b> (양호실 침대 쟁탈전)<br>\n6. <b>Cheotsarangui Ondo</b> (첫사랑의 온도)<br>\n7. <b>Joahaneun Gangaji Isseo?</b> (좋아하는 강아지 있어?)<br>\n8. <b>Bomui Ireum</b> (봄의 이름)<br>\n9. <b>DELETE</b> (DELETE)<br>\n10. <b>No Jaemin Zone</b> (No 재민 Zone)<br>\n11. <b>Heart Trigger Off</b> (하트 트리거 오프)<br>\n12. <b>Yeonmineun Sajeorira</b> (연민은 사절이라)<br>\n13. <b>Jeonhaksaengeun Meokgo Sipeo</b> (전학생은 먹고 싶어)<br>\n14. <b>After buzzer beater</b> (After buzzer beater)",
